      "text": "必须坚信自己的选择",
      "endMs": 201420,
      "durationMs": 2290
    },
    {
      "startMs": 201420,
      "text": "那些真正重要的事物",
      "endMs": 204760,
      "durationMs": 3340
    },
    {
      "startMs": 204760,
      "text": "如何我都不愿失去",
      "endMs": 207760,
      "durationMs": 3000
